.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-verify 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-verify \- Exit 0 only if a release carries every asset, its checksums match, and it is published and immutable at its own tag
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release verify\fR [\fB\-\-draft\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItag\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Exit 0 only if a release carries every asset, its checksums match, and it is published and immutable at its own tag
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-draft\fR
Verify a draft, read through the assets API, rather than a published, immutable release
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItag\fR>
The release\*(Aqs tag
